sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant D as State / History
    C->>S: CLIENT_HELLO + final cursor
    S->>D: since() + active_snapshot()
    D-->>S: Finals + latest provisionals
    Note over S: Enqueue and register without await
    S-->>C: HISTORY
    S-->>C: Latest provisional snapshots
    S-->>C: Live updates
    Note over C: applyCaption / acceptUpdate
